            <ArticleTitle>Concomitant Kienböck's and Preiser's diseases: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1149-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Reports of simultaneous carpal avascular necrosis in more than 1 bone are rare. This is a report of simultaneous Kienböck's disease and Preiser's disease in a 50-year-old woman with a remote history of steroid use but without a history of trauma or systemic illness.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
